{"speciesId":207,"names":{"fr":"Scorplane","es":"Gligar","en":"Gligar","ja":"グライガー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It flies straight at its target's face then clamps down on the star­ tled victim to inject poison."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It usually clings to cliffs. When it spots its prey, it spreads its wings and glides down to attack."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It builds its nest on a steep cliff. When it is done gliding, it hops along the ground back to its nest."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"GLIGAR glides through the air without a sound as if it were sliding. This POKéMON hangs on to the face of its foe using its clawed hind legs and the large pincers on its forelegs, then injects the prey with its poison barb."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"GLIGAR glides through the air without a sound as if it were sliding. This POKéMON hangs on to the face of its foe using its clawed hind legs and the large pincers on its forelegs, then injects the prey with its poison barb."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It glides without making a single sound. It grasps the face of its foe using its hind and large front claws, then stabs with its poison barb."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It usually clings to cliffs. When it spots its prey, it spreads its wings and glides down to attack."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It flies straight at its target’s face, then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It sails on the winds with its limbs extended to strike from the sky. It aims for the prey’s face."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It sails on the winds with its limbs extended to strike from the sky. It aims for the prey’s face."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It glides as if sliding. It startles foes by clamping on to their faces, then jabs with its poison stinger."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It flies straight at its target’s face, then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It usually clings to cliffs. When it spots its prey, it spreads its wings and glides down to attack."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il fend l’air et fond sur sa proie pour s’agripper à son visage et la frapper avec son dard."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It glides as if sliding. It startles foes by clamping on to their faces, then jabs with its poison stinger."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il fend l’air et fond sur sa proie pour s’agripper à son visage et la frapper avec son dard."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It glides as if sliding. It startles foes by clamping on to their faces, then jabs with its poison stinger."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It clamps on to its chosen prey then jabs the stinger on its tail into the prey while it’s stunned with surprise."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It clamps on to its chosen prey then jabs the stinger on its tail into the prey while it’s stunned with surprise."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il s’accroche souvent aux falaises. Sa proie repérée, il plane vers elle pour l’attaquer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"A veces se sujeta a los precipicios. Cuando divisa una presa, despliega sus alas y planea para atacar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It usually clings to cliffs. When it spots its prey, it spreads its wings and glides down to attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"いつもは 崖に 張りついている。 獲物を見つけると 羽を広げ 風に乗り 襲いかかってくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vole droit vers le visage de sa cible effrayée et s’y accroche pour lui injecter son poison."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vuela directo a la cara del objetivo y acaba con su aterrada víctima inyectándole veneno."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It flies straight at its target’s face, then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"顔面 めがけて 飛んでくる。 張りつかれた 獲物が 驚く あいだに 毒針を 刺しこむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Scorplane plane dans les airs sans un bruit, comme s’il glissait. Ce Pokémon s’accroche au visage de son ennemi grâce aux serres de ses pattes arrière et aux pinces de ses pattes avant, et pique avec son dard empoisonné."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Gligar planea por el aire sin hacer ningún ruido, como si fuera patinando. Este Pokémon se agarra a la cara de su rival con las patas traseras, con forma de garra, y las pinzas de las delanteras y le inyecta veneno por el aguijón."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Gligar glides through the air without a sound as if it were sliding. This Pokémon hangs on to the face of its foe using its clawed hind legs and the large pincers on its forelegs, then injects the prey with its poison barb."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"音を 立てず 滑る ように 滑空する。 両腕の 大きな ツメと 足の ツメで 獲物の 顔に しがみつき 毒針を 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Scorplane plane dans les airs sans un bruit, comme s’il glissait. Ce Pokémon s’accroche au visage de son ennemi grâce aux serres de ses pattes arrière et aux pinces de ses pattes avant, et pique avec son dard empoisonné."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Gligar planea por el aire sin hacer ningún ruido, como si fuera patinando. Este Pokémon se agarra a la cara de su rival con las patas traseras, con forma de garra, y las pinzas de las delanteras y le inyecta veneno por el aguijón."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Gligar glides through the air without a sound as if it were sliding. This Pokémon hangs on to the face of its foe using its clawed hind legs and the large pincers on its forelegs, then injects the prey with its poison barb."},{"language":"ja